description:
Create a theme context system. Export `ThemeProvider` (wraps children with a context providing `'light'` or `'dark'`) and `useTheme()` which returns `{ theme, toggleTheme }`. Attempting to use `useTheme` outside a `ThemeProvider` should throw an error.

**Example:**
```tsx
function App() {
  return (
    <ThemeProvider>
      <ThemedButton />
    </ThemeProvider>
  );
}

function ThemedButton() {
  const { theme, toggleTheme } = useTheme();
  return <button onClick={toggleTheme}>{theme}</button>;
}
```

